    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/0c80dd198d85d4ad6b04a03c48b2a786.poster.avif?t=1696535529\" width=480 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/0c80dd198d85d4ad6b04a03c48b2a786.webm?t=1696535529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/0c80dd198d85d4ad6b04a03c48b2a786.mp4?t=1696535529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>**Welcome to Pixel Princess Arena**</strong><br><br>Pixel Princess Arena is a game that invites you to embark on an adventure at your own pace. Take control of your heroes, strategically place them on the battlefield, and reshape your tactics as often as you desire. Should you encounter defeat, fear not\u2014try the battle anew and emerge victorious.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/d3210fede2ae44a811ad933489735bfa.poster.avif?t=1696535529\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/d3210fede2ae44a811ad933489735bfa.webm?t=1696535529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/d3210fede2ae44a811ad933489735bfa.mp4?t=1696535529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Leveling Up Heroes</strong>: Combine 3 identical heroes to level them up and unlock an array of skills.<br></li><li><strong>Unique Items</strong>: Each item possesses distinctive abilities that, when equipped by heroes, grant them newfound power.<br></li><li><strong>Powerful Blessings</strong>: Teams can harness up to 3 Blessings, bestowing formidable bonuses upon them.<br></li><li><strong>Mysterious Encounters</strong>: Forge your own path as you chart your course. Take the riskier route for greater rewards or tread the safer path to steady progress.<br></li><li><strong>Special Maps</strong>: Utilize the unique tile effects present in each map to secure victory in battle.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/0c80dd198d85d4ad6b04a03c48b2a786.poster.avif?t=1696535529\" width=480 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/0c80dd198d85d4ad6b04a03c48b2a786.webm?t=1696535529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/0c80dd198d85d4ad6b04a03c48b2a786.mp4?t=1696535529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>**Welcome to Pixel Princess Arena**</strong><br><br>Pixel Princess Arena is a game that invites you to embark on an adventure at your own pace. Take control of your heroes, strategically place them on the battlefield, and reshape your tactics as often as you desire. Should you encounter defeat, fear not\u2014try the battle anew and emerge victorious.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/d3210fede2ae44a811ad933489735bfa.poster.avif?t=1696535529\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/d3210fede2ae44a811ad933489735bfa.webm?t=1696535529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621640/extras/d3210fede2ae44a811ad933489735bfa.mp4?t=1696535529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Leveling Up Heroes</strong>: Combine 3 identical heroes to level them up and unlock an array of skills.<br></li><li><strong>Unique Items</strong>: Each item possesses distinctive abilities that, when equipped by heroes, grant them newfound power.<br></li><li><strong>Powerful Blessings</strong>: Teams can harness up to 3 Blessings, bestowing formidable bonuses upon them.<br></li><li><strong>Mysterious Encounters</strong>: Forge your own path as you chart your course. Take the riskier route for greater rewards or tread the safer path to steady progress.<br></li><li><strong>Special Maps</strong>: Utilize the unique tile effects present in each map to secure victory in battle.</li></ul>",
